    {
      "id": "concept-us-nuclear-command-engineer-red-button",
      "kind": "concept",
      "promptEs": "cadena de mando nuclear · botón rojo · ingeniero",
      "questionEn": "What is the joke in the nuclear command chart?",
      "answerEn": "The formal hierarchy is bypassed by the engineer who physically installed the red button.",
      "noteEn": "A chain-of-command diagram normally shows authority flowing from senior leaders through military commands. The dotted line humorously gives the installer a direct, informal relationship to the president, as though knowing the hardware could outrank the official structure.",
      "tags": [
        "concept",
        "joke",
        "military",
        "diagram"
